							<!-- Post -->
							My advice...get your money by check or money order, Paypal sucks if the buyer charges back on you.  If the buyer is willing to wait a couple of days then it&#039;s the best way to go.<br><br>If the buyer wants a server transfer tell him that&#039;s fine, but he pays the fee before you make the transfer.  Talking to someone very recently about selling a character and the buyer wanting a server transfer; SOE required the first and last 4 digits of the original CC used for the account, and I think the CD key as well (not positive it was the CD key, might have been more billing info).  Either way, always get your money up front.  Since Paypal has a 3 day waiting period between the time you receive money into your account, and the time they can finalize a transfer of the funds to your bank account, there&#039;s plenty of time for a "buyer" to reverse the transaction.<br><br>Also, look into IGE.  Out of curiosity I mailed them details on my Kihk account and they offerred $250 for it.  So if you&#039;re only lookin for a couple hundred bucks they might make that offer.<br><br>-beak

